&lt;prefix&gt;images&lt;/prefix&gt;
&lt;/listObjectVersions&gt;
</code></pre> getBucketRequestPayment<p>The getBucketRequestPayment operation returns the request payment configuration of a bucket. To use this operation, the user must be the bucket owner. See the related API documentation for more information.  Parameter Name Description Required bucketName The name of the bucket. Yes responseVariable Name of the variable to which the output of the operation should be assigned. Yes overwriteBody Replace the Message Body in Message Context with the output of the operation (This will remove the payload from the above variable). Yes </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;amazons3.getBucketRequestPayment&gt;
