&lt;/getBucketRequestPayment&gt;
</code></pre> getBucketVersioning<p>The getBucketVersioning operation returns the versioning state of a bucket. To retrieve the versioning state of a bucket, the user must be the bucket owner. This implementation also returns the MFA Delete status of the versioning state. If the MFA Delete status is enabled, the bucket owner must use an authentication device to change the versioning state of the bucket. See the related API documentation for more information.  Parameter Name Description Required bucketName The name of the bucket. Yes responseVariable Name of the variable to which the output of the operation should be assigned. Yes overwriteBody Replace the Message Body in Message Context with the output of the operation (This will remove the payload from the above variable). Yes </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;amazons3.getBucketVersioning&gt;
