&lt;/amazonsqs.setQueueAttributes&gt;
</code></pre> getQueueAttributes<p>This operation gets attributes for the specified queue. See the related API documentation for more information.  Parameter Name Description Required queueId The unique identifier of the queue. Yes queueName The name of the queue. Yes attributes A list of attributes to retrieve information for. No </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;amazonsqs.getQueueAttributes&gt;
