</code></pre> listQueues<p>This operation returns a list of the queues in the current region. See the related API documentation for more information.  Parameter Name Description Required queueNamePrefix A string to use for filtering the list results. No </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;amazonsqs.listQueues&gt;
