&lt;overwriteBody&gt;false&lt;/overwriteBody&gt;
&lt;/facebookAds.deleteCampaign&gt;
</code></pre> <p>Sample request</p> <pre><code>{
"campaign_id": "123123123"
}
</code></pre> createAdSet<p>The <code>createAdSet</code> operation creates an ad set.  Parameter Name Description Required <code>adAccountId</code> ID of the ad account. Yes <code>properties</code> A JSON object containing the adset properties. See the Ad set parameters documentation for all the available properties. Yes <code>responseVariable</code> Variable name to store the response payload. Yes <code>overwriteBody</code> Replace the current message payload with the operation response. No (Default: false) </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;facebookAds.createAdSet configKey="FB_CONN_1"&gt;
