}
}
</code></pre> deleteAdSet<p>The <code>deleteAdSet</code> operation deletes an ad set.  Parameter Name Description Required <code>adSetId</code> ID of the ad set. Yes <code>responseVariable</code> Variable name to store the response payload. Yes <code>overwriteBody</code> Replace the current message payload with the operation response. No (Default: false) </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;facebookAds.deleteAdSet configKey="FB_CONN_1"&gt;
&lt;adSetId&gt;{json-eval($.ad_set_id)}&lt;/adSetId&gt;
&lt;responseVariable&gt;deleteResponse&lt;/responseVariable&gt;
