</code></pre> <p>Sample request</p> <pre><code>{
"ad_id": "456456456",
"properties": {
"name": "New Furniture Ad 2",
"status": "PAUSED"
}
}
</code></pre> deleteAd<p>The <code>deleteAd</code> operation deletes an ad.  Parameter Name Description Required <code>adId</code> ID of the ad. Yes <code>responseVariable</code> Variable name to store the response payload. Yes <code>overwriteBody</code> Replace the current message payload with the operation response. No (Default: false) </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;facebookAds.deleteAd configKey="FB_CONN_1"&gt;
&lt;adId&gt;{json-eval($.ad_id)}&lt;/adId&gt;
&lt;responseVariable&gt;deleteResponse&lt;/responseVariable&gt;
