"pageToken":"00965906535058580458",
"labelIds":"UNREAD",
"q":"Jira"
}
</code></pre> readMail<p>The readMail operation retrieves a message by its ID. See the related API documentation for more information.  Parameter Name Description Required id The ID of the message to retrieve. Yes format The format to return. Yes metadataHeaders When the format is METADATA, only include the headers specified in this property. Yes </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;gmail.readMail ConfigKey="GmailConnection"&gt;
