</code></pre> <p>Sample request</p> <pre><code>{
"id":"14bbb686ba287e1d"
}
</code></pre> unTrashThreads<p>The unTrashThreads operation removes a thread from the trash. See the related API documentation for more information.  Parameter Name Description Required id The ID of the thread to untrash. Yes </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;gmail.unTrashThreads&gt;
