&lt;valueRenderOption&gt;{${payload.valueRenderOption}}&lt;/valueRenderOption&gt;
&lt;fields&gt;{${payload.fields}}&lt;/fields&gt;
&lt;/googlespreadsheet.getMultipleCellData&gt;
</code></pre> <p>Sample request</p> <p>This will allow you to get cell data by specifying multiple cell range using ranges parameter. Here we can specify multiple cell ranges as a comma sperated.</p> <p><pre><code>{
"clientId":"617729022812-xxxxxxxxxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com",
"clientSecret":"xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx",
