{
"values": [["7","8"],["9","10"]],
"range": "Sheet1!A6"
}
]
}
</code></pre> Sample response</p> <p>In the response we will get updated cell, range details as as array in responses property.</p> <pre><code>{
"spreadsheetId": "12KoqoxmykLLYbtsm6CEOggk5bTKMEIFGCD9EBdrXFGA",
"totalUpdatedRows": 2,
