</code></pre> <p>Sample request</p> <p>The following request deletes the conditional formatting rule having index 0 in the sheet specified by sheetId.</p> <p><pre><code>{
"clientId":"617729022812-vjo2edd0i4bcb38ifu4qg17ke5nn6f2m.apps.googleusercontent.com",
