&lt;/googlespreadsheet.cutRange&gt;
</code></pre> <p>Sample request</p> <p>The following request cuts the range A1:D10 and pastes its data, formats, formulas, and merges to the F1:I10 range on the same sheet. The original source range cell contents are removed.</p> <p><pre><code>{
"clientId":"617729022812-xxxxxxxxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com",
