&lt;/googlespreadsheet.repeatCellsBatchRequest&gt;
</code></pre> <p>Sample request</p> <p>Here the formating specified in "cell" object will be repeted for row index from 13 to 15.</p> <p><pre><code>{
"clientId":"617729022812-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com",
"clientSecret":"xxxxxxxxxxxxx",
