}
]
}
</code></pre> getDashboardById<p>This operation returns a JSON representation of the dashboard details, including its name, ID, and more.  Parameter Name Description Required id Identifies the dashboard that you want to get. Yes </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;jira.getDashboardById&gt;
