}
</code></pre> <p>Sample response</p> <p>Returned 204 if the issue is successfully assigned.</p> getTransitions<p>To get a list of the possible transitions the current user can perform for an issue, use <code>getTransitions</code> and specify the issue ID.  Parameter Name Description Required issueIdOrKey Identifies the issue to update. This can be an issue ID or an issue key. Yes expand The parameters to expand. No </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;jira.getTransitions&gt;
