</code></pre> <p>Sample response</p> <p>Returned 204 if the transition was successful.</p> getComments<p>To get the comments for an issue, use <code>getComments</code> with the issue ID.  Parameter Name Description Required issueIdOrKey Identifies the issue that has the comments. This can be an issue ID, or an issue key. Yes expand The parameters to expand. No </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;jira.getComments&gt;
