getUser<p>To get information about a specified user, use <code>getUser</code> and specify the username.</p> <p> Parameter Name Description Required usernameFilter Identifies the user whose information you want to get. Yes key The user key. No </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;jira.getUser&gt;
