</code></pre> <p>Sample request</p> <p>The following is a sample REST/JSON request that can be handled by the <code>getUser</code> operation.</p> <pre><code>{
"usernameFilter":"fred"
}
</code></pre> <p>Sample response</p> <p>Given below is a sample response for the <code>getUser</code> operation.</p> <pre><code>{
