</code></pre> getAttachmentContent<p>This operation retrieves the content of an attachment.</p> <p> Parameter Name Description Required attachmentUrl The URI of the attached file. Yes fileType Type of the attachment. Yes </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;jira.getAttachmentContent&gt;
