create<p>The <code>salesforce.create</code> operation creates a new record by specifying the following properties. See the related API documentation for more information.  Parameter Name Description Required Sample Value sObjectName The type of object for which you will create a record. Yes Account fieldAndValue The .json format property used to create the record. Include all mandatory fields according to the requirements for the specified sObject. Yes <pre>{
