"name": "wso2",
"description":"This Account belongs to WSO2"
}
}
</code></pre> createBulk<p>The <code>salesforce.createBulk</code> operation creates multiple records of the same sObject type by specifying the following properties. See the related API documentation for more information.  Parameter Name Description Required Sample Value sObjectName The type of object for which you will create a record. Yes Account fieldAndValue The .json format property, which specifies each record as an entry within the records array. Include all mandatory fields according to the requirements for the specified sObject. Yes <pre>{
