</code></pre> createTree<p>To create nested records for a specific sObject, use salesforce.createTree and specify the following properties. See the related API documentation for more information.  Parameter Name Description Required Sample Value sObjectName The type of object for which you will create a record. Yes fieldAndValue The .json format property, which specifies each record as an entry within the records array. Include all mandatory fields according to the requirements for the specified sobject. Yes <pre>{
