        "name": "wso2",
        "description":"This Account belongs to WSO2"
        }
        </pre> Id The ID of the record you are updating. Yes 00128000002OOhD </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;salesforce.update&gt;
&lt;sObjectName&gt;{${payload.sObjectName}}&lt;/sObjectName&gt;
&lt;fieldAndValue&gt;{${payload.fieldAndValue}}&lt;/fieldAndValue&gt;
&lt;Id&gt;{${payload.Id}}&lt;/Id&gt;
