"name": "wso2",
"description":"This Account belongs to WSO2"
}
}
</code></pre> delete<p>The <code>salesforce.delete</code> operation deletes a record and requires the following properties. See the related API documentation for more information.  Parameter Name Description Required Sample Value sObjectName The object type of the record. Yes Account Id The ID of the record you are deleting. Yes 00128000002OOhD </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;salesforce.update&gt;
