}
</code></pre> retrieveSObject<p>The <code>salesforce.retrieveSObject</code> operation retrieves details of a specific record. See the related API documentation for more information.  Parameter Name Description Required Sample Value sObjectName The object type of the record. Yes Account rowId The ID of the record whose details you want to retrieve. Yes 00128000005YjDnAAK </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;salesforce.retrieveSObject&gt;
