</code></pre> <p>Sample request</p> <pre><code>{
"values": [
207807736
]
}
</code></pre> insertDataExtensionRowSet<p>The <code>insertDataExtensionRowSet</code> operation upsert one or more rows in a data extension synchronously by specifying the external key of the target data extension.  Parameter Name Description Required <code>externalKey</code> The external ID, also known as the customer key, for the data extension. No <code>payload</code> The properties required to insert data extension row set. Yes </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;salesforceMarketingCloud.insertDataExtensionRowSet configKey="SFMC_CON"&gt;
