"body": [
{
"values": {
"SubscriberKey": "email address",
"EmailAddress": "email address"
}
},
{
"values": {
"SubscriberKey": "email address",
"EmailAddress": "email address"
}
}
]
}
</code></pre> sendEmailMessage<p>The <code>sendEmailMessage</code> operation sends a message to multiple recipients using a send definition.  Parameter Name Description Required <code>payload</code> The properties required to send an e-mail message. Required if <code>inputStructure</code> is <code>INLINE</code> <code>definitionKey</code> The ID of the send definition. Required if <code>inputStructure</code> is <code>FORM</code> <code>recipients</code> Recipient parameters and metadata. Cannot be used with single recipient array. Required if <code>inputStructure</code> is <code>FORM</code> <code>attributes</code> Personalization attributes for the message as key-value pairs. No </p> <p>Sample configuration for "INLINE"</p> <pre><code>&lt;salesforceMarketingCloud.sendEmailMessage configKey="SFMC_CON"&gt;
&lt;inputStructure&gt;INLINE&lt;/inputStructure&gt;
