emails<p>The salesforcebulk.emails method creates and sends an email using Salesforce based on the properties that you specify. See the related API documentation for more information.  Parameter Name Description Required sendEmail XML representation of the email. Yes </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;salesforce.sendEmail&gt;
&lt;sendEmail xmlns:sfdc="sfdc"&gt;{//sfdc:emailWrapper}&lt;/sendEmail&gt;
&lt;/salesforce.sendEmail&gt;
</code></pre> <p>Sample request</p> <p>Given below is a sample request that can be handled by the sendEmail operation.</p> <pre><code>&lt;payloadFactory&gt;
&lt;format&gt;
&lt;sfdc:emailWrapper xmlns:sfdc="sfdc"&gt;
&lt;sfdc:messages type="urn:SingleEmailMessage"&gt;
&lt;sfdc:bccSender&gt;true&lt;/sfdc:bccSender&gt;
&lt;sfdc:emailPriority&gt;High&lt;/sfdc:emailPriority&gt;
&lt;sfdc:replyTo&gt;123@gmail.com&lt;/sfdc:replyTo&gt;
&lt;sfdc:saveAsActivity&gt;false&lt;/sfdc:saveAsActivity&gt;
&lt;sfdc:senderDisplayName&gt;wso2&lt;/sfdc:senderDisplayName&gt;
&lt;sfdc:subject&gt;test&lt;/sfdc:subject&gt;
&lt;sfdc:useSignature&gt;false&lt;/sfdc:useSignature&gt;
&lt;sfdc:targetObjectId&gt;00390000001PBFn&lt;/sfdc:targetObjectId&gt;
&lt;sfdc:plainTextBody&gt;Hello, this is a holiday greeting!&lt;/sfdc:plainTextBody&gt;    &lt;/sfdc:messages&gt;
&lt;/sfdc:emailWrapper&gt;
&lt;/format&gt;
&lt;args/&gt;
&lt;/payloadFactory&gt;

&lt;salesforce.sendEmail&gt;
&lt;sendEmail xmlns:sfdc="sfdc"&gt;{//sfdc:emailWrapper}&lt;/sendEmail&gt;
&lt;/salesforce.sendEmail&gt;
</code></pre> sendEmailMessage<p>The salesforcebulk.sendEmailMessage method sends emails that have already been drafted in Salesforce. See the related API documentation for more information.  Parameter Name Description Required sendEmailMessage XML representation of the email IDs to send. Yes </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;salesforce.sendEmailMessage config-ref="connectorConfig"&gt;
&lt;sendEmailMessage xmlns:sfdc="sfdc"&gt;{//sfdc:emails}&lt;/sendEmailMessage&gt;
&lt;/salesforce.sendEmailMessage&gt;
