</code></pre> <p>Sample request</p> <pre><code>{
"siteId": "site123",
"itemId": "item789"
}
</code></pre> deleteList<p>The <code>deleteList</code> operation deletes the specified list within a SharePoint site. Upon successful execution, the targeted list is removed from the site.  Parameter name Description Required <code>siteId</code> The unique identifier of the SharePoint site where the list resides. Type: <code>string</code> Yes <code>listId</code> The unique identifier of the list to be deleted. Type: <code>string</code> Yes </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;sharepoint.deleteList configKey="SHAREPOINT_CONN"&gt;
