"groupId": "group123"
}
</code></pre> getListById<p>The <code>getListById</code> operation retrieves detailed information about a specific SharePoint list using its unique identifier (GUID). Upon successful execution, the operation returns metadata and properties of the specified list.  Parameter name Description Required <code>siteId</code> The unique identifier of the SharePoint site where the list resides. Type: <code>string</code> Yes <code>listId</code> The unique identifier (GUID) of the list to be retrieved. Type: <code>string</code> Yes </p> <p>Sample configuration</p> <pre><code>&lt;sharepoint.getListById configKey="SHAREPOINT_CONN"&gt;
